Rejig: write a backup or an edited layout only to the iPhone it came from.
Applies to ios_homescreen/ui/session.py and ui/errors.py from
https://github.com/YakupEmreYerli/ios-homescreen at commit
97649547dbc44295e451c6bf130a87404481e10c. The editor loads a backup with load_backup, which
drops the recorded device, then opens whichever phone is connected; Apply checks only the
layout fingerprint. Both now compare the recorded UDID with the opened phone before writing.
